  .string "a true Pokémon trainer.\p"
  .string "So, I'll play 4 Pokémon cries\n"
  .string "and you'll have to guess\l"
  .string "the Pokémon the cry corresponds\l"
  .string "to.\p"
  .string "You up for it?$"


