brendanfuschia_Text_1::
  .string "Oh hey {COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}{COLOR BLUE}!\p"
  .string "Fancy meeting you here.\p"
  .string "...You took down the boss, huh?\p"
  .string "I'm really sorry I couldn't be there\n"
  .string "for it, but I was never really worried\l"
  .string "about you.\p"
  .string "I've recently obtained the {COLOR GREEN}Mega Ring{COLOR BLUE},\n"
  .string "so I'd like to put myself to the test!\p"
  .string "...I see you've got one too!\p"
  .string "Let's not hold back then!$"


brendanfuschia_Text_Defeat::
  .string "Heh... not bad...\n$"


brendanfuschia_Text_2::
  .string "I feel the gap between us shrinking\n"
  .string "each time.\p"
  .string "I know I can do it!\p"
  .string "But, thanks for being a sport as\n"
  .string "always.\p"
  .string "With {COLOR GREEN}Sabrina's{COLOR BLUE} badge, you should be\n"
  .string "able to use this.$"


brendanfuschia_Text_3::
  .string "Safe travels pal!$"


